{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116737","id":3322738602,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7GDPeq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116737","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116737.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116737.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116737","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116737/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116737/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116737/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/abdde1b69d1a74c44043b4304950c857799b499c","number":116737,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Core: Remove `class_db.h` include from `ref_counted.h`","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Helps address #111218\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n- `Ref` templates for `PtrToArg`, `GetTypeInfo`, and `VariantInternalAccessor` were migrated to the original headers, as there's no longer a risk of circular includes.\r\n- Headers with functions operating on `ClassDB` directly had their logic migrated to implementation files.\r\n\r\nI know there's been hesitation in the past about tackling the removal of `class_db.h` includes[^1], but I think the changes here demonstrate that this warrants revisiting. Even after migrating `ClassDB` logic to implementation files, many headers & implementation files alike *still* needed additional includes. This is because several of the affected files weren't for `Object` subclasses at all; plenty of utilities were including `class_db.h` indirectly!\r\n\r\nThis isn't even mentioning the current cost of these includes. `class_db.h` and `ref_counted.h` both rank in the top 5 of fresh compile **and** recompile times. While `Object` and `Variant` are likely the two \"real\" compile-time culprits, `Ref` wasn't helping matters with a direct include of `ClassDB`. So while it'll likely still rank fairly high, it's feasible that this change alone could dethrone `ref_counted.h` as the single most expensive file from a fresh compilation.\r\n\r\n[^1]: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111573#pullrequestreview-3330940683","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":